<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Results</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix provides some supplementary data (Fig. <a href="#A5.F17" title="Figure 17 ‣ Appendix E Results ‣ Tokenizing Semantic Segmentation with RLE" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>, <a href="#A5.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Appendix E Results ‣ Tokenizing Semantic Segmentation with RLE" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> and Tables <a href="#A5.T13" title="Table XIII ‣ Appendix E Results ‣ Tokenizing Semantic Segmentation with RLE" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">XIII</span></a>, <a href="#A5.T14" title="Table XIV ‣ Appendix E Results ‣ Tokenizing Semantic Segmentation with RLE" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">XIV</span></a>) and configuration details (Table <a href="#A5.T12" title="Table XII ‣ Appendix E Results ‣ Tokenizing Semantic Segmentation with RLE" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">XII</span></a>) that have been used in Sec. <a href="#S5" title="V Results ‣ Tokenizing Semantic Segmentation with RLE" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">V</span></a>.</p>
</div>
