<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A5.F18.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 18</span>: </span><span id="A5.F18.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Impact of (left and center) replacing <math id="A5.F18.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> video frames with the first frame and (right) video length <math id="A5.F18.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> and stride <math id="A5.F18.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> on P2S-VIDSEG performance over (top) early and (bottom) late-stage configurations of the IPSC dataset.
</span></figcaption>
